            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogw'okubanza ogw'omukama Sirasi owa Paasa, MUKAMA akamuleetera omwoyo, arangirre obukama bwe bwona kandi eki arangiriire akihandiike, ekigambo MUKAMA eki yagambisize Yeremiya nukwo kibe.",
          "type": "text",
