            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 44:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sirasi omukama wa Paasa akagamba ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'iguru, anfoire mulemi w'ensi yoona kandi andagiire kumwombekera enju omu rubuga Yerusaalemu orwa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu weena omuli inywe abantu be, Ruhanga we abe na uwe, kandi omuntu ogu agende Yerusaalemu orwa Yuda, ayombekere buhyaka MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Isirairi enju-nuwe Ruhanga anyakwikara Yerusaalemu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omuntu weena ayasigaireho, hoona nambere ali akoonyerwe abantu b'owaabu, bamuhe efeeza na zaabbu, bamuhe ebintu n'ebisoro, otabaliireho ebihongwa eby'okwegondeza ebireeterwa enju ya Ruhanga eya Yerusaalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo haimukire abakuru ab'amaju ga baisenkuru b'Abayuda n'Ababenyamiini, haimuka baanyakatagara n'Abaleevi, buli muntu Ruhanga ouyatairemu omwoyo ogw'okugenda kwombekera MUKAMA buhyaka enju omurubuga Yerusaalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "boona abakaba baheerraine nabo, bakabaha ebikwato eby'efeeza n'ezaabbu, ebintu n'ebisoro, n'ebintu eby'omuhendo, otabaliireho ebi ebyaleetwagwa habw'okwegondeza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sirasi omukama, kandi omunju ya MUKAMA, akaihamu ebikwato omukama Nebbukadeneeza ebi akaba aihire Yerusaalemu, yabita omunju y'embandwa ze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikwato ebi, akabikwasa Misiredaasi, omukeeto yabibarra Sesebazaara omubiito wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gunu nugwo gwabaire muhendo ogw'ebintu byona: Ebbeseni rukumi eza zaabbu, ebbeseni rukumi ez'efeeza; n'emihyo abiri na mwenda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebbeseni asatu eza zaabbu, ebbakuli enkumi ibiri nebbina n'ikumi ez'efeeza n'ebikwato ebindi rukumi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebikwato byona ebya zaabbu n'eby'efeeza, bikahika enkumi itaano ebikumi bbina omu nkaaga na mwenda. Enzaahi obu ikaba nizihwa Babbulooni nizitwarwa Yerusaalemu ebi byona Sesebazaara akabitwara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
